{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>粉嶺公路發生車禍。今晚（26日）9時許，一輛客貨車沿粉嶺公路往上水方向行駛，途經華明邨對開時，懷疑失控掃毀12個水馬和12個閃光燈，繼而翻側，41歲李姓男司機一度被困車內，隨後自行爬出車外。李男沒有受傷，拒絕送院，警方正調查車禍原因。</p><p>據了解，有人報稱駕駛期間，打算拾起物件，因而肇禍。</p><p>根據網上圖片，消防和警方到場。</p><figure><img alt=\"客貨車翻側。（Facebook專頁「香港公共交通智庫」圖片）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261126/1202773148366278656294710.jpeg/DZE8T6KyBCw_qqcqDRxYD9XKwi_FEA7yu2K2BLtitgQ\"/><figcaption>客貨車翻側。（Facebook專頁「香港公共交通智庫」圖片）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"客貨車翻側。（Facebook專頁「香港公共交通智庫」圖片）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261126/1202770053381099520043687.jpeg/XlYhCwKEA3Q-VxwVrbP93nGemSnnYJBWnTDN850wzfM\"/><figcaption>客貨車翻側。（Facebook專頁「香港公共交通智庫」圖片）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"消防和警方到場。（Facebook專頁「香港公共交通智庫」圖片）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261126/1202770050864386048620157.jpeg/Ar569Kcv1fNLBrYTPvkQQ-B5zscKgAB1PDpvTzw6b08\"/><figcaption>消防和警方到場。（Facebook專頁「香港公共交通智庫」圖片）</figcaption></figure></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-26T16:03:56.647785+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":254,"images":3,"source":"HK01 突發","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-26T15:52:54+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-26T16:37:46.145638+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-26T15:57:26.020221+00:00","content_hash":"2ece7d1cb4c97fcf0bdeba10912ef16439d75ab4492541360199c97aca31ba75","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}